source: tests/help.rs
expression: text
---
Create an alias to a directory, the current one by default

Usage: furet alias add [OPTIONS] <NAME> [PATH]

Arguments:
  <NAME>  Letters, digits, `_` and `-`; case-insensitive
  [PATH]  Target directory; defaults to the current directory

Options:
      --force  Replace an existing alias with the same name
  -h, --help   Print help
